      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ERIZA SPARKLES (2) shapes well for this after finishing second last start over 400m at Bulli but in a scintillating 22.08 behind Zipper On Time. Recorded a big figure last time and looks the one to beat here. SUPER SASSY (1) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a strong early sectional and went on to clock 29.67 in a 4 length win at Gosford over 515m. Yet to miss the placings from three starts out of this box. One of main contenders. TOWERING EARL (8) was favourite last start and led all the way, scoring by 7 lengths (29.56) at Nowra in a Grade 4/5 over 520m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Capable of going well again. RUGGED ETHICS (7) is a last-start placegetter worth considering.",
